{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/bf63fbf176e1e309fdee851abfb721b3.avif?t=1766167927\" width=545 height=252 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot Line - Season 2</strong> is a pirate-themed AVN adventure that <strong>continues a journey from Season 1</strong> through a vibrant fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a simple treasure hunt, you'll explore stunning landscapes, encounter a diverse crew of characters, and get to experience a world filled with unique kinks and niches.<br><br>The game contains - <strong>5800+ HD renders</strong><br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 - <strong>250 HD animations with sound effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/81af56de39e229e1e5c9c090fa6a8ab2.webp?t=1766167927\" width=616 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/b3032c8ba595ea1bad31e03e5c92657c.avif?t=1766167927\" width=601 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/7975d42acf8ec770598e73ddc783708f.poster.avif?t=1766167927\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/7975d42acf8ec770598e73ddc783708f.webm?t=1766167927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/7975d42acf8ec770598e73ddc783708f.mp4?t=1766167927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/81af56de39e229e1e5c9c090fa6a8ab2.webp?t=1766167927\" width=616 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/b6766f299bae4c018d2a8353b1f141cb.avif?t=1766167927\" width=601 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey is more than just about survival and treasure. Every decision you make defines your path:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be a true leader who earns the respect of your crew, or a reckless captain who stumbles through chaos?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you uncover the hidden truths of your past, or let them sink beneath the waves forever?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Season 2 continues the saga with <strong>expanded storylines, new characters, deeper relationships, and tougher choices</strong> that shape not only your fate, but the destiny of everyone aboard. Explore a world where lust, loyalty, betrayal, and adventure collide on the high seas \u2014 and where the line between <strong>hero and villain</strong> is as thin as the horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/05228c0ffc1cf43f9bdf33ef65963a1c.poster.avif?t=1766167927\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/05228c0ffc1cf43f9bdf33ef65963a1c.webm?t=1766167927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030400/extras/05228c